    "text": "............................................................\n Prints: danieleskridge.com/featured/pi…\n ............................................................\n\nA pair of pirate ships sail lazily through calm waters as the sun sets in a cloud filled sky.\n\nI started this scene out just to test out some clouds textures that I've been working on.  I thought the clouds turned out pretty well, so I decided to turn it into a nautical scene with a calm sea to reflect the light from the sky.  \n\nI created this image using CGI techniques as well as some digital painting applications.\n\nResources:\nPoser: IntrovertArtist.com/Poser\nThe Medusa: IntrovertArtist.com/medusa\nGIMP:  IntrovertArtist.com/Gimp    \nVue: IntrovertArtist.com/Vue\nPhotomatix: IntrovertArtist.com/Photomatix\n\nThanks for looking,\nDaniel Eskridge\n\nP.S. \n\nFollow me on Facebook: www.facebook.com/TheArtOfDanie…\nAlso, I have a Zazzle store: www.zazzle.com/artofdanieleskr…\nand, of course, a blog: www.introvertartist.com",
