    "type": "post",
    "title": "high-rise",
    "text": "Hi sorry I haven't uploaded in a while did this one a few months ago just never uploaded it. I made a 3d base for this one with some parts from Nick Govacko as well as some of my own then a paint over in Photoshop.  I know I say this every time but I'm going to upload some new stuff and some more old stuff I haven't posted more frequently. Feel free to leave comments or questions ill try to make time to answer them.  Hope you enjoy!\n\nwww.artstation.com/artist/h0st…",
